OL,3,GNEWSADecision expected on shore-side
OL,4,Aharbour plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial multimillion-pound plan
OL,7,Fto redevelop a town's docks is due to
OL,8,Fbe decided at a meeting later.
OL,10,FThe proposals to dredge the harbour in
OL,11,FFalmouth, Cornwall, will allow cruise
OL,12,Fships and other large vessels to dock -
OL,13,Fbut there are serious concerns about
OL,14,Fthe impact on the environment.
OL,16,FCornwall Council's Strategic Planning
OL,17,FCommittee is due to decide on the
OL,18,Fshore-side element of the #150m
OL,19,Fredevelopment at a meeting from 10:00
OL,20,FGMT at County Hall, Truro.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
